This repository contains research data objects used in the article "Human HYPOMAP - A comprehensive spatiocellular map of the human hypothalamus" by Tadross, Steuernagel and Dowsett et al.

There are 4 data objects, namely

1) human_HYPOMAP_snRNASeq.rds - the Single-nuclear sequencing Seurat V4 data object in RDS format

2) human_HYPOMAP_snRNASeq.h5ad - the Single-nuclear sequencing data object in Anndata (h5ad)format

3) human_HYPOMAP_snRNASeq_scvi_model.pt - SCVI model file for data projection/label transfer

4) humanHYPOMAP_spatial.rds - 10X Visium spatial transcriptomics Seurat V4 data object in RDS format

The R objects can be opened using Seurat V4.1.3/R 4.3.1, sessionInfo() below:

