An RStudio docker image with the installed packages is also available from 

https://hub.docker.com/r/brianlamx/seurat_rstudio

For the Anndata (h5ad) object, please use the following docker image:

https://hub.docker.com/r/lsteuernagel/r_scvi_docker_v3/

Please note that the SCVI model was built using panda 1.5.2 and scvi 0.19.0 is not compatible with panda 2.0+


